   "'Recommended Major Electives: Complete the following number of credits: 9-14' — student chooses one focus. Each focus is recorded with option_group 'Focus'. Where a focus has a core block followed by an 'Additional ... Electives' block, the two blocks together form one focus option (core + additional), not alternatives to each other: Digital Fabrication (core + Additional Digital Fabrication Electives), Drawing, Graphic Art, Small Scale Metal/Jewelry, Painting, Printmaking, Public Arts (core ART 33A + three 'Recommended' blocks), Sculpture, Art Photography. Focus totals are recorded in stated on the core block.",
